hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1262","Yunus bin Abdul-Ala told us, Ibn Wahb told us, Yunus told me, on the authority of Ibn Shihab, on the authority of Salem bin Abdullah bin Omar, on the authority of His father, he said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, used to say the tasbih over the camel woman before any direction he went, and say the Witr prayer over her, but he did not pray over her. ""written"""
